sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as publish.yml
  participant T as tlog.py
  participant CO as cosign
  participant SE as seal.py
  W->>T: event release.approved
  W->>T: checkpoint (origin, size, root)
  W->>CO: sign-blob checkpoint
  CO-->>W: checkpoint.sigstore.json
  W->>T: verify (every checkpoint, consistency, signatures)
  W->>SE: write manifest.json (rules_root and log head)
  W->>CO: sign-blob manifest.json
  CO-->>W: manifest.sigstore.json
  W->>T: release-proof (inclusion proof for the candidate.accepted entry)
  T-->>W: inclusion-proof.json
